&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This position is US based only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Account Executive to join as a founding member of the sales team for our new Advertising Solutions (Quests) business line. This role is perfect for someone passionate about the entertainment industry and eager to help companies in this space market to their most dedicated audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a global role where you will work in a dynamic, zero-to-one environment to build and grow a new, fast-expanding business line at Discord. You will harness your prior experience in advertising/media/marketing spaces and bring a combination of strategic business thinking, industry relationships, product insights, and an ability to build a significant, recurring book of business with clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address clients&#39; marketing needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop tailored solutions and proposals that deliver value to entertainment industry clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In order to hit revenue and account goals, you will:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and source media buying opportunities with film studios, streaming platforms, television networks, and their media agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deepen relationships within the entertainment industry with stakeholders &amp;amp; key decision makers at the brand direct and agency levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close deals to meet revenue and account goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help clients achieve business and marketing goals using Discord’s solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy effective and repeatable sales strategies. Apply an account planning process to prioritize accounts, grow revenue, educate clients, lead strategic client conversations, and navigate complex relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and convey compelling sales presentations and proposals utilizing internal and external data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in Discord solutions and adapt recommendations to suit varying entertainment client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with clients and contribute to marketing and media plans that enable them to reach their target audiences on Discord&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate expertise around the gaming, media, and marketing spaces to clients, within Discord, and in industry forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience as an Account Executive in direct ad sales, media buying, or digital advertising, with a focus on the entertainment industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of meeting or exceeding account and revenue goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing entertainment clients throughout the funnel with a deep understanding of their challenges and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building relationships with top marketing decision-makers in the entertainment industry and their agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze data and identify insights to assess campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to proactively troubleshoot and problem-solve quickly and through the proper escalation channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with marketing and ad technology ecosystem including ability to collect and convey product needs as well as working cross-functionally to diagnose and solve technical problems for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in negotiating and structuring standard and non-standard ad-buying agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel for regional in-person client meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The total annual target compensation range for this full-time position is $255,000 to $320,850 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;inclusion, diversity and purpose efforts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, company &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/the-seven-principles-of-working-at-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;principles&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, or learn more about the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#life-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Life @ Discord&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; experience!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Developer Compliance is dedicated to safeguarding Discord&#39;s platform, ensuring that applications from third-party developers meet our safety standards and policies. This role is crucial in maintaining a trustworthy environment where our users can confidently explore and enjoy diverse offerings from external creators. The Developer Compliance Analyst will report to the Developer Compliance Manager, and will serve as an expert in the detection of abusive applications and content violations in the Discord Developer Ecosystem. Discord is looking for a candidate with a deep understanding of the technical underpinnings of how APIs function, experience in detecting and assessing abusive behavior and fraudulent practices, and confidence in understanding and explaining highly complex issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for detecting and reporting on Developer Policy violations and recommending scaled approaches to ensuring that 3rd-party apps are not being developed or used in abusive or non-compliant ways. We&#39;re looking for someone who is highly collaborative and versatile in their approaches, has experience interpreting internal policies and regulatory mandates, and be able to communicate technical complexity and policy considerations with a range of technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage technical expertise and sound judgment to review and evaluate bots and user generated content for compliance with our Community Guidelines and Developer Policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop internal products for detecting and assessing violations in our developer ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write reports and analyze trends on emerging issues within the platform ecosystem, for a cross-functional audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product, Legal, Trust &amp;amp; Safety, and Communications teams in responding to sensitive issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze new and potential features and propose plans to help reduce or remove 3rd-Party abuse before it happens&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent education/experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with utilizing APIs and/or SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience composing and understanding advanced SQL queries, as well as the ability to compose and understand Javascript and Python based internal tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with standard software development practices, such as spec creation, code review, version control, and writing technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for supporting our users and developers with unwavering patience and empathy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguous situations and get excited about figuring out solutions to complex problems, and then executing on them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to translate complicated findings or technical approaches in easy to-understand ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to work with amazing, passionate people who care deeply about solving challenging problems to keep Discord a safe place for users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Last but not least - a collaborative attitude and a healthy dose of natural curiosity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience enforcing and/or interpreting developer policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience with cyber-security, fraud detection, and Trust and Safety work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $152,000 to $167,000 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;inclusion, diversity and purpose efforts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, company &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/the-seven-principles-of-working-at-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;principles&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, or learn more about the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#life-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Life @ Discord&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; experience!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of Business Development, Gaming&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is US based only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Director of Business Development who is passionate about building new partnerships that will accelerate our gaming initiatives with game developers, studios, and publishers. You will build partnership strategies and lead its execution including sourcing and negotiating complex, high-impact deals. You will interact with senior executives at our partner organizations and be a trusted evangelist for Discord’s products and priorities. Internally, you will be an advocate for our partners and bring the “voice of the partner” to inform business and product decisions. This is an individual contributor role and will report into the Head of Business Development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full life-cycle of partnership execution from initial partner engagement through deal structuring and agreement closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and cultivate relationships with key industry players and decision-makers at potential partner companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate and refine Discord value proposition to secure partner commitments entering into mutually beneficial, sustainable relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal product, engineering and marketing teams to deliver feedback and refine our offerings for large scale partner adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the partner management team and cross-functional colleagues including finance, marketing, operations, legal and product to ensure partner success and achieve defined KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of proven experience in business development and partnerships experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience in the gaming industry - PC, console and/or mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of deal making experience including technical product-driven deals and first-of-kind partnership work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work with internal cross-functional teams at early stages to define and articulate partner value within the context of Discord&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge and experience in the gaming space including industry trends, company thinking and an informed perspective on perceived opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communications skills (verbal and written) with the ability to inspire and engage C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop new ideas and independently build a business case and pitch it to relevant stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience structuring complex partnerships and navigating challenging contract negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energetic team player with a sense of humor, humility, kindness &amp;amp; empathy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closing win-win partnerships is in your DNA and gives you purpose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You play a lot of games and understand making the player experience better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $218,000 to $240,000 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;inclusion, diversity and purpose efforts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, company &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/the-seven-principles-of-working-at-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;principles&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, or learn more about the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#life-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Life @ Discord&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; experience!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This position is US based only. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Director of Sales to join as a founding member of the sales team for our Advertising Solutions (Quests) business line. This role is perfect for someone passionate about the entertainment industry and eager to help companies in this space market to their most dedicated audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a global role where you will work in a dynamic, zero-to-one environment to build and grow a new, fast-expanding business line at Discord. You will harness your prior experience in advertising/media/marketing spaces and bring a combination of strategic business thinking, industry relationships, product insights, and an ability to build a significant, recurring book of business with clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for hitting revenue and account goals by
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;prospecting and sourcing media buying opportunities with film studios, streaming platforms, television networks, and their media agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;building &amp;amp; deepening relationships within the entertainment industry with executive stakeholders &amp;amp; key decision makers at the brand direct and agency levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;helping clients achieve business and marketing goals via Discord’s ad solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;building and scaling a best-in-class sales team within the entertainment vertical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will define and execute effective and repeatable sales motions and operational processes. You will apply an account planning process to prioritize accounts, grow revenue, educate clients, lead strategic client conversations, and navigate complex relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will create and convey compelling sales presentations and proposals utilizing internal and external data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will become an expert in Discord solutions and adapt recommendations to suit varying client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for consulting with clients and contributing to marketing and media plans that enables them to reach their target audiences on Discord.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will demonstrate expertise around the gaming, media, and marketing spaces to clients, within Discord, and in industry forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over time you may also be called upon to manage teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of direct experience in direct ad sales, media buying, or digital advertising in the entertainment industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing entertainment clients throughout the funnel with a deep understanding of their challenges and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building relationships with top marketing decision-makers at entertainment studios&amp;nbsp; and their agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing clients throughout the funnel with a deep understanding of their challenges and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze data and identify insights to assess campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to proactively troubleshoot and problem solve quickly and through the proper escalation channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with marketing and ad technology ecosystem including ability to collect and convey product needs as well as working cross-functionally to diagnose and solve technical problems for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in negotiating and structuring standard and non-standard ad buying agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in growing, mentoring, and managing sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;T&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;he total annual target compensation range for this full-time position is $354,000 to $389,000 + equity + benefits. Our compensation ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed reflect the OTE (base salary + target variable compensation) only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;inclusion, diversity and purpose efforts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, company &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/the-seven-principles-of-working-at-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;principles&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, or learn more about the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#life-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Life @ Discord&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; experience!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Sr. Director of Workplace IT to elevate our exceptional IT team. In this role, you&#39;ll infuse new strategic insight and advanced technical expertise into our high-performing team. Your mission is to refine our IT operations, ensuring seamless collaboration for Discord employees from any location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The IT team manages laptops, A/V systems, networking, and a range of cross-functional projects with Systems, Engineering, and Security. A key focus will be on automating our current manual processes to boost efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll play a crucial role in enhancing daily operations for every Discord employee, whether they&#39;re onsite or working remotely. Your impact will be significant, driving productivity and connectivity across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position reports to the Senior Director of Workplace. This person will be expected to come into the office at least twice a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow an IT team: Manage a dedicated team of IT professionals to support Discord employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop IT strategy: Plan and execute the Workplace IT strategy and create policies to align with evolving business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate and innovate: Identify and implement opportunities for automation in IT support and recommend new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster cross-departmental relationships: Build key relationships with departments like Engineering Security, Engineering Infrastructure, Finance, and Procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage IT infrastructure and equipment: Oversee the maintenance and updating of hardware (laptops, networks, A/V systems) and manage IT vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure IT risk management: Work with IT teams to address risks such as disaster recovery, data loss, and maintain proper access controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee helpdesk and software: Manage the IT helpdesk to ensure high-quality customer service and curate software and licenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle budgeting and metrics: Draft the annual IT budget, assist in planning, and maintain metrics for continuous improvement and high user satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Information Technology, Information Systems, Computer Science, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least eight years in IT operations and three years in managing IT teams and projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong focus on customer service with excellent presentation and training abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in computer systems, networks, security, telecommunications, A/V systems, databases, and storage; familiar with Discord’s systems (Okta, Oracle, Workday, Zendesk).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in a dynamic, startup environment and implement automation in IT support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience setting IT strategy, building complex metrics/analytics, and making data-driven recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in using scripting languages like Python, Bash, and PowerShell for automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective in managing tasks and projects, coordinating with multiple stakeholders, and leading IT operations with a team-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
