&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in touching the whole cloud infrastructure stack - from disks to networking to permissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data warehouses like Druid, BigQuery, or Redshift&lt;/li&gt;
