&lt;li&gt;Strong operations and project management skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel in ambiguous environments - excited about finding solutions to complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the gaming industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial or start-up background&lt;/li&gt;
