&lt;p&gt;We are seeking our first Head of Integrated Marketing, a pivotal role responsible for deeply understanding our customers, crafting clear marketing strategies, and leading impactful campaigns and activations. You will identify key moments on our calendar and roadmap, seamlessly stitching together our efforts across audiences, business units, and teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Head of Integrated Marketing, you will start with the customer—understanding them inside and out—then leverage this insight to create and implement strategies that align with our business and brand needs. You’ll collaborate cross-functionally to bring these strategies to life, ensuring clarity, cohesiveness, and strong customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must be an exceptional communicator, collaborator, and leader. You’ll excel at recognizing and writing outstanding briefs, and know great work when you see it. You thrive at lifting others up around you and will be leading a small team of Integrated Marketers and Program Managers. You will report to the Vice President of Marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
