&lt;p&gt;Given this team&#39;s unique position in the company, you will help establish coordination and communication between various teams, such as Product Management, Engineering, Finance and accounting, and our Talent teams. With these teams, you will drive our planning and forecasting process, ensuring that both are aligned with our longer-term strategic and financial aspirations. In addition, you will gain invaluable experience that offers autonomy, deep interactions with business partners, and the opportunity to impact a rapidly growing business.&lt;/p&gt;
