&lt;p&gt;Join Activities Studio at Discord, where we’re redefining social gaming experiences! As Discord insiders with deep game industry experience, we are innovating on the platform, creating games that demonstrate the full potential of Discord’s Activities feature and pushing the boundaries of what apps on Discord can do. Together, we’ll come up with new ways for millions of Discord users to play, compete, and connect, inspiring new Discord Developers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a game developer software engineer who can rapidly prototype new experiences, make the best ones production-ready, and scale them to serve millions of Discord users.&lt;/p&gt;
