&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end development of data tooling and frameworks, using modern technologies such as BigQuery, Apache Beam, Airflow, Dagster, dbt, Kubernetes, and Rust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure tight-knit collaboration with leadership, cross-functional stake-holders and senior engineers across the organization. Collaborate with leadership and senior engineers across the team to define the technical vision and build on the technical roadmap for Data Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Data Platform to ensure we have a platform with strong governance that respects our users&#39; privacy throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care deeply about business outcomes and constraints and keep them in mind as you solve hard, unbounded problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor the next generation of technical leaders at Discord.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
